    <string name="main_adb_steps">On your phone, open Settings › About phone and tap Build number seven times to turn on Developer options.\nOpen Settings › System › Developer options and switch on USB debugging.\nConnect your phone to a computer that has Android\'s platform tools (adb) and allow USB debugging when your phone asks.\nTap Copy, send the command to the computer, and run it there in a command window:</string>
