    <string name="main_guide_defaults_steps">Open a popup and tap the sliders button at the top.\nChoose what is normal for each setting, and whether a notification shows while something differs.\nThe popup\'s tile lights up and names what differs. Reset, in the popup or the notification, puts it back.</string>
    <string name="main_guide_defaults_title">Defaults</string>
    <string name="main_guide_tiles_steps">On the main screen, tap a tile or popup and confirm to add it to Quick Settings.\nOr open Quick Settings, tap the pencil and drag the tiles in.\nTouch and hold a tile in Quick Settings to open its popup or Android\'s settings.</string>
    <string name="main_guide_tiles_steps_edit">Open Quick Settings and tap the pencil.\nDrag the tiles of this app into your tiles.\nTouch and hold a tile to open its popup or Android\'s settings.</string>
